      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That's a good start for the tone. To make it even more impactful for the scene, I want to see him get more specific about *why* he thinks it's a \"natural order.\" Could you expand on that? Maybe have him talk about the specific differences he sees between the races—like intelligence or temperament—and how those differences justify why one group should be in charge. I want the audience to feel the weight of his conviction through those specific 'scientific' or 'moral' justifications people used back then.",
